  "description": "The NMT (Neurodiagnostic Montage Template) Scalp EEG Dataset comprises 2,417 clinical EEG recordings acquired using the standard 10-20 electrode montage with 19 EEG channels plus 2 reference electrodes. The dataset includes both normal and abnormal recordings in EDF format with variable sampling rates and durations, designed to support EEG-based pathology detection and normal/abnormal classification tasks in clinical neurophysiology research. This dataset was derived from the source data available on Zenodo (doi:10.5281/zenodo.10909103).",
